                                <td   align="center">备注</td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td colspan="4">说明：</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="4">1，未回复视为默认接单<img id="logo"  style="z-index: -1; position: absolute;right:150px; width: 4cm;" src="@Url.Content("~/Content/Images/123.png")" /></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="4">2，材料探伤合格，符合国家二级标准，不可有夹层，板面要平，无沙眼，无裂纹。</td>
            </tr>
